Netrunner Cards Data
====================

This repository is an unofficial community dataset. It is not associated with,
produced by, or endorsed by Null Signal Games, Fantasy Flight Games,
R. Talsorian Games, or Wizards of the Coast.

Card titles, types, subtypes, costs, and printed text are reference material
from Null Signal Games Netrunner releases (including System Gateway and System
Update 2021). Pack-level catalog extracts for generate scripts are taken from a
pinned commit of Null-Signal-Games/netrunner-cards-json (see
data/nsg-catalog-pin.json), not from the live NetrunnerDB public API.
Structured Effect IR and pool metadata are hand-authored for the nhoople rules
engine and are not official rulings.

Netrunner is a trademark of R. Talsorian Games, Inc. Android is a trademark
of and copyright Fantasy Flight Games.

